{"data": {"id": "10.5281/zenodo.23932665", "type": "dois", "attributes": {"doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23932665", "prefix": "10.5281", "suffix": "zenodo.23932665", "identifiers": [], "alternateIdentifiers": [], "creators": [{"name": "Kiani, Amirkianoosh", "nameType": "Personal", "givenName": "Amirkianoosh", "familyName": "Kiani", "affiliation": ["Ontario Tech University"], "nameIdentifiers": []}], "titles": [{"title": "care-quantum-fleet-twin: fleet normal-behaviour models and quantum feature maps on the CARE wind-turbine benchmark (code and results, v1.0.0)"}], "publisher": "Zenodo", "container": {}, "publicationYear": 2026, "subjects": [{"subject": "wind turbine"}, {"subject": "normal-behaviour model"}, {"subject": "CARE benchmark"}, {"subject": "quantum machine learning"}, {"subject": "SCADA fault detection"}], "contributors": [], "dates": [{"date": "2026-11-03", "dateType": "Issued"}], "language": null, "types": {"ris": "COMP", "bibtex": "misc", "citeproc": "article", "schemaOrg": "SoftwareSourceCode", "resourceType": "", "resourceTypeGeneral": "Software"}, "relatedIdentifiers": [{"relationType": "HasVersion", "relatedIdentifier": "10.5281/zenodo.23932666", "relatedIdentifierType": "DOI"}], "relatedItems": [], "sizes": [], "formats": [], "version": "1.0.0", "rightsList": [{"rights": "MIT License", "rightsUri": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT", "schemeUri": "https://spdx.org/licenses/", "rightsIdentifier": "mit", "rightsIdentifierScheme": "SPDX"}], "descriptions": [{"description": "Code and results for the article \"Fleet normal-behaviour models for fault detection on unseen wind turbines and a controlled test of quantum feature maps on CARE\" (submitted to Results in Engineering, 2026). The package contains the complete source code (fleet normal-behaviour model, CUSUM alarm rule, sensor selection, quantum feature-map and classical heads, exact statevector simulator, IBM Quantum runners), the analysis protocol with its frozen versions and SHA-256 hashes, every result table the manuscript is built from, the cached head scores of the data-efficiency studies (A16, A18), the IBM Quantum job manifests, transpiled circuits and raw measurement counts, an environment lockfile, and REPRODUCE.md, which maps every table and figure of the paper to the command that regenerates it. The CARE dataset itself (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.15846963) is not included. The vendored scorer is Fraunhofer IEE's EnergyFaultDetector (MIT licence). MD5 of the archive: 758968f4af8b2cd267e7c16427926832.\n\n\u00a0\n\nUse of AI-assisted tools. AI-assisted tools were used in developing, restructuring, commenting and formatting the analysis code, in running and documenting the analyses, and in editing, formatting and proofreading the text, tables and figures to improve their flow and presentation. The research concept, study design, methods, experiments, analyses, interpretation and conclusions are the author's own and are not AI-generated; every AI-assisted output was reviewed, checked and approved by the author, and all results regenerate from the deposited code and result files. No restricted data and no access credentials are included in this archive.", "descriptionType": "Abstract"}], "geoLocations": [], "fundingReferences": [], "xml": "", "url": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23932665", "contentUrl": null, "metadataVersion": 0, "schemaVersion": "http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4", "source": "api", "isActive": true, "state": "findable", "reason": null, "viewCount": 0, "viewsOverTime": [], "downloadCount": 0, "downloadsOverTime": [], "referenceCount": 0, "citationCount": 0, "citationsOverTime": [], "partCount": 0, "partOfCount": 0, "versionCount": 1, "versionOfCount": 0, "created": "2026-11-03T22:44:55.000Z", "registered": "2026-11-03T22:44:55.000Z", "published": "2026", "updated": "2026-11-03T22:44:55.000Z"}, "relationships": {"client": {"data": {"id": "cern.zenodo", "type": "clients"}}, "provider": {"data": {"id": "cern", "type": "providers"}}, "med